cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RedFence or RedFenceBench in research, please cite this software."
title: "RedFence: stateful enterprise AI security evaluation"
abstract: >-
  RedFence is an open-source AI security assessment platform. Its core research
  component, RedFenceBench, measures security invariant violations across the
  lifecycle of stateful enterprise RAG applications and tool-using agents using
  deterministic oracles and recorded evidence.
type: software
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "RedFence Contributors"
keywords:
  - ai-security
  - rag
  - benchmark
  - authorization
  - agents
